      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثاورهُ</span></b> , (T, M, A, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثَاوَرَةٌ</span> (S, M, K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِوَارٌ</span>, (Lh, M, K,) <i>He leaped,</i> or <i>sprang, upon
him,</i> or <i>at him; he assaulted,</i> or <i>assailed, him;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاثَبَهُ</span>, (T, S, M, A, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاوَرَهُ</span>. (T, A.)

